WEBVTT

00:01:27.458 --> 00:01:33.476
at the expense of designing and collecting
high-quality and contextual data.

00:01:33.500 --> 00:01:37.768
We need to stop the data,
or the biased data that we already have,

00:01:37.792 --> 00:01:40.184
and focus on three things:

00:01:40.208 --> 00:01:41.809
data infrastructure,

00:01:41.833 --> 00:01:43.226
data quality

00:01:43.250 --> 00:01:45.351
and data literacy.

00:01:45.375 --> 00:01:46.684
In June of this year,

00:01:46.708 --> 00:01:51.476
we saw embarrassing bias
in the Duke University AI model

00:01:51.500 --> 00:01:53.059
called PULSE,

00:01:53.083 --> 00:01:56.101
which enhanced a blurry image

00:01:56.125 --> 00:02:00.143
into a recognizable
photograph of a person.